    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Way of the Ace",
    "steam_appid": 3784850,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your own customizable character and make your name known as the best player on the court! Personalize your character with color customization and choose your number to stand out! Change the color of your hair, eyes, uniform, kneepads, socks, and shoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a powerful spike serve or an unpredictable jump float serve to start off the battle for the point!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/8df4419cdf9e011bc381fecfebd1b598.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/8df4419cdf9e011bc381fecfebd1b598.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/8df4419cdf9e011bc381fecfebd1b598.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your receive precisely to get the ball neatly to your setter so they can set up your team's next attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/9aab3784830189ee8bf6b8c8e3a35148.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/9aab3784830189ee8bf6b8c8e3a35148.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/9aab3784830189ee8bf6b8c8e3a35148.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the ball to your wing spikers and formulate the best plans in order to thwart the enemy blockers and rack up assists for your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/69f9dc0819b75efac810a8a77b26de88.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/69f9dc0819b75efac810a8a77b26de88.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/69f9dc0819b75efac810a8a77b26de88.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspire your teammates by smashing through every wall in your way. Fly high and spike the ball with all your might to score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/61eda05d1c1f3968ba4d77535e53d8fb.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/61eda05d1c1f3968ba4d77535e53d8fb.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/61eda05d1c1f3968ba4d77535e53d8fb.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form an iron wall to protect your allies by blocking the enemy team's spikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/b9d3f940224aad4b1ed86a0526be92fc.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/b9d3f940224aad4b1ed86a0526be92fc.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/b9d3f940224aad4b1ed86a0526be92fc.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the net your domain. Make the skies your territory. Prove you are the best. Write your own volleyball story in the way of the ace.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your own customizable character and make your name known as the best player on the court! Personalize your character with color customization and choose your number to stand out! Change the color of your hair, eyes, uniform, kneepads, socks, and shoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a powerful spike serve or an unpredictable jump float serve to start off the battle for the point!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/8df4419cdf9e011bc381fecfebd1b598.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/8df4419cdf9e011bc381fecfebd1b598.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/8df4419cdf9e011bc381fecfebd1b598.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your receive precisely to get the ball neatly to your setter so they can set up your team's next attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/9aab3784830189ee8bf6b8c8e3a35148.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/9aab3784830189ee8bf6b8c8e3a35148.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/9aab3784830189ee8bf6b8c8e3a35148.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the ball to your wing spikers and formulate the best plans in order to thwart the enemy blockers and rack up assists for your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/69f9dc0819b75efac810a8a77b26de88.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/69f9dc0819b75efac810a8a77b26de88.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/69f9dc0819b75efac810a8a77b26de88.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspire your teammates by smashing through every wall in your way. Fly high and spike the ball with all your might to score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/61eda05d1c1f3968ba4d77535e53d8fb.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/61eda05d1c1f3968ba4d77535e53d8fb.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/61eda05d1c1f3968ba4d77535e53d8fb.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form an iron wall to protect your allies by blocking the enemy team's spikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/b9d3f940224aad4b1ed86a0526be92fc.poster.avif?t=1749496079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/b9d3f940224aad4b1ed86a0526be92fc.webm?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784850/extras/b9d3f940224aad4b1ed86a0526be92fc.mp4?t=1749496079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the net your domain. Make the skies your territory. Prove you are the best. Write your own volleyball story in the way of the ace.</p>",
